        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これならワガハイたちの個性を\nぱぱ～んと発揮できるでにゃんす！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "猫柳さんは突拍子もないことばかり言うので、\n一時はどうなることかと思いましたが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "神速一魂のお二人が来てくださったおかげで、\n形になってよかったです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "向こうも、ヒントを貰えたってなんだか喜んでる\nみたいだったし、話せてよかったんじゃないかしら。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今回は、全員で協力して作り上げる特別なライブ\nですから。話し合いは重要です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "互いに刺激し合い、客席に笑顔の花を咲かす、\nこれもまた美しき芸の形でにゃんすなぁ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ、そうね。衣装はもちろん、新曲もライブも\nみんなの力できっと素敵なものになるわ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "共に打ち合わせをしたF-LAGSのみなさんも、\nこの案を見て喜ばれていましたね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
